esp_hint = ESP-01S: 3.3 V supply (NOT 5 V!). Programming mode: GPIO0 connected to GND at power-up, CH_PD (EN) to 3.3 V. Select the port in the Port (-P) field above, e.g. /dev/ttyUSB0.
