ota_no_file = No .bin file selected
ota_hint = OTA only works if the ESP already runs a program with ArduinoOTA support - flash it over a cable the first time (ESP8266 tab). The .bin file is a compiled sketch (Arduino IDE: Sketch -> Export Compiled Binary). The computer and the ESP must be on the same network, and the computer's firewall must allow the incoming connection from the ESP.
